            "detailed_description": "<h1>How to play online ?</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/2ef4d4f6097315548fccb1629eb6c146.avif?t=1577184439\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br>Even though online multiplayer is not officially supported, you can play CHOP online with your friends using Parsec.<br>It's free, very easy and you can play any local multiplayer/coop game online, even old games on emulators !<br><br>1. Download the client from . Run it and create an account. Get your friends to do the same.<br>2. If you want to host, click &quot;Create a party&quot; at the top left (you need Windows 10 to host). Launch CHOP on Steam in windowed mode.<br>3. In Parsec, enable CHOP in the approved apps. Set the game name and public/private setting.<br>4. To join a friend who's hosting, add him using his Parsec username. Once he accepted your friend request, click on his username, then click &quot;join&quot;, then &quot;play&quot;<br>5. Host : run the game, and friends can play just like they're sitting next to you !<br><br>If you have any issues with Parsec, contact them on their discord here : </p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=680 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Eager to get back to the <strong>golden age of local multiplayer games</strong> ? Want to crush your friends after practicing hard on a <strong>skill-based</strong> and <strong>competitive</strong> game ? We've got the game for you.<br><br>CHOP is a <strong>visceral game</strong> where bloody killings meet ultra fast action.<br>With easily accessible games mechanics, it offers a real strategic dimension and a depth of gameplay that will put your skills to the test.<br><br><strong>One hit to kill, respawn almost instantly</strong>. CHOP gives you a feeling close to the constant adrenaline rush you can experience in a fast FPS.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blood and guts in a world torn asunder, with a <strong>comic book vibe</strong> : it's for anyone who likes gore, comics, post-apo, and who's looking for a supercharged party game.<br><br><strong>Up to four players</strong> can play at a time. Challenge your friends one-on-one or enter the fray. You can even team up and play two-on-two, or one vs. three if you've got the guts for it.<br><br>Are you up for the goriest couch game for your pizza/beers party ?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rush Out :</h2>The game offers a <strong>unique twist</strong> with this mode.<br>Here, no matter how many players you kill. <br>Your goal is to rush out through your portal as fast as possible. Don't worry, you still need to kill, as it's the only way to open the portal. <br>It closes if you die, so you'll be under a lot of pressure when it comes to escaping.<br>Don't mess around, just <strong>kill someone and rush out !</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> From 1 to 4 player local multiplayer<br></li><li> Glorious dismemberments, delightful executions, silly gory graphics all wrapped up in a comic book style.<br></li><li> 3 game modes<br></li><li> Tournament mode available for each game mode<br></li><li> 4 playable characters<br></li><li> 4 special abilities<br></li><li> Same hitbox and basic skills = perfect balancing<br></li><li> Blistering moves<br></li><li> Various arenas<br></li><li> Random bonuses to spice up battles<br></li><li> Many options to customize your games</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=680 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/849cafc1dd43220ece609fa6639cd061.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Eager to get back to the <strong>golden age of local multiplayer games</strong> ? Want to crush your friends after practicing hard on a <strong>skill-based</strong> and <strong>competitive</strong> game ? We've got the game for you.<br><br>CHOP is a <strong>visceral game</strong> where bloody killings meet ultra fast action.<br>With easily accessible games mechanics, it offers a real strategic dimension and a depth of gameplay that will put your skills to the test.<br><br><strong>One hit to kill, respawn almost instantly</strong>. CHOP gives you a feeling close to the constant adrenaline rush you can experience in a fast FPS.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ffcbcd666f4a1712665fa17fbb662f3c.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blood and guts in a world torn asunder, with a <strong>comic book vibe</strong> : it's for anyone who likes gore, comics, post-apo, and who's looking for a supercharged party game.<br><br><strong>Up to four players</strong> can play at a time. Challenge your friends one-on-one or enter the fray. You can even team up and play two-on-two, or one vs. three if you've got the guts for it.<br><br>Are you up for the goriest couch game for your pizza/beers party ?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rush Out :</h2>The game offers a <strong>unique twist</strong> with this mode.<br>Here, no matter how many players you kill. <br>Your goal is to rush out through your portal as fast as possible. Don't worry, you still need to kill, as it's the only way to open the portal. <br>It closes if you die, so you'll be under a lot of pressure when it comes to escaping.<br>Don't mess around, just <strong>kill someone and rush out !</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> From 1 to 4 player local multiplayer<br></li><li> Glorious dismemberments, delightful executions, silly gory graphics all wrapped up in a comic book style.<br></li><li> 3 game modes<br></li><li> Tournament mode available for each game mode<br></li><li> 4 playable characters<br></li><li> 4 special abilities<br></li><li> Same hitbox and basic skills = perfect balancing<br></li><li> Blistering moves<br></li><li> Various arenas<br></li><li> Random bonuses to spice up battles<br></li><li> Many options to customize your games</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/ef2a6beb33aa7965dab07a6f731b755d.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.poster.avif?t=1577184439\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.webm?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755920/extras/277dc4e0ca27f40236b8d793632c160e.mp4?t=1577184439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
